<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 5.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 5.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Mar 5	 Mar 4	Dec 31 96   NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  268.300     267.790     247.020    8.61 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.500     304.550     306.830   -0.76 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.690     156.725     158.970   -1.43 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.450	46.444	47.182   -1.55 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  432.580     432.760     419.180    3.20 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.310     139.325     141.685   -1.68 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.728	15.708	16.185   -2.82 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  220.820     219.850     212.430    3.95 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.849	 1.888   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.560	 1.561	 1.581   -1.33 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  180.715     180.575     183.135   -1.32%</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
